OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrests over fatal
OL,4,Astabbing of teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuad Mohamud, 21, of Thorn Hill Walk,
OL,7,FBriar Hill, Northampton, and Samrawi
OL,8,FSoloman, 20, of Haslewood Square,
OL,9,FLeeds, who were charged with murder,
OL,10,Fpleaded not guilty at Northampton Crown
OL,11,FCourt on Monday.
